    S(D, 'Anlam Bütünlüğünü Bozan Cümle', '(I) Smartphones have become cheaper as the number of manufacturers has increased. (II) Volcanic eruptions can have effects far beyond the area where they occur. (III) Huge amounts of ash released into the atmosphere can disrupt air travel across entire continents. (IV) Fine particles may also reflect sunlight back into space, causing global temperatures to fall temporarily. (V) After one large eruption in 1815, for example, parts of Europe and North America experienced an unusually cold summer the following year.',
      secenekler=I_V, cevap='A',
      cozum='Parça yanardağ patlamalarının uzak bölgelere etkilerini anlatır; konu II. cümleyle başlar. Akıllı telefon fiyatlarından söz eden I. cümle konu dışıdır.', yonerge=Y_ILGISIZ),
